  "display_name": "Shield Charge",
  "display_fullname": "Brute Defense Shield Defense Shield Charge",
  "display_help": "You can throw all of your might behind your shield and charge through ranks of foes in the blink of an eye.  Using this power allows you to teleport to a selected area to deal significant smashing damage to all foes near the location you teleport to, most foes that are struck by your Shield Charge will be knocked down.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Very Long.",
